// legobattles-decomp: the executable's icon (lb_app.ico, from lbapp.png).
// Resource 1 is the icon Explorer and shortcuts show; lb_setup.cpp points SDL's
// SDL_WINDOWS_INTRESOURCE_ICON hint at it, so every window and its taskbar
// button use it too.
1 ICON "lb_app.ico"
// BR-0108: the manifest (lb_app.manifest). Besides what the toolchain's default
// one says (run as the user; the Windows versions it knows), it makes UTF-8 the
// process's code page (Windows 10 1903 and later): every narrow-string path (the
// command line, the exe's own folder, fopen) is then UTF-8, so an install folder
// with any characters in its name works; older Windows ignores it. DPI awareness
// stays in code (lb_setup.cpp). Keep XML comments out of the manifest: Windows'
// side-by-side parser refuses the whole file for a malformed one.
1 24 "lb_app.manifest"
